  "description": "LILDUH crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H62 Dy4 N32 O5,6(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy1E (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy1K (Dy) has 3 O neighbors; Dy1N (Dy) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.655-3.904 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.88-116.92°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C68H74N32Dy4O11. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
